  <!-- EN: hound drone pack -->
  <DMS_Apparel_PackHound.label>獵犬部署背包</DMS_Apparel_PackHound.label>
  <!-- EN: A container and assembly kit for carrying and deploying remote-controlled  hound drones, capable of quickly deploying a Hound drone in combat and acting as a remote-controlled base station to control and recover the drone. -->
  <DMS_Apparel_PackHound.description>用於在戰鬥中攜帶和部署獵犬無人機的大號背包，並能夠作為遙控基站來指揮和回收無人機。</DMS_Apparel_PackHound.description>
  <!-- EN: drone -->
  <DMS_Apparel_PackHound.comps.CompApparelReloadable.chargeNoun>無人機</DMS_Apparel_PackHound.comps.CompApparelReloadable.chargeNoun>
  <!-- EN: on cooldown -->
  <DMS_Apparel_PackHound.comps.CompApparelReloadable.cooldownGerund>準備中</DMS_Apparel_PackHound.comps.CompApparelReloadable.cooldownGerund>
  <!-- EN: hound drone pack -->
  <DMS_Apparel_PackHound.verbs.Verb_Deploy.label>部署獵犬</DMS_Apparel_PackHound.verbs.Verb_Deploy.label>
  
  <!-- EN: verlingbrid drone belt -->
  <DMS_Apparel_PackVerling.label>槳鳥部署腰帶</DMS_Apparel_PackVerling.label>
  <!-- EN: A remote controller and assembly module for deploying verlingbrid drones, capable deploying drones in combat and acting as a remote-controlled base station to control the drones. -->
  <DMS_Apparel_PackVerling.description>用於在戰鬥中攜帶和部署槳鳥無人機的遙控器和組裝模組，並能夠作為遙控基站來指揮和回收無人機。</DMS_Apparel_PackVerling.description>
  <!-- EN: drone -->
  <DMS_Apparel_PackVerling.comps.CompApparelReloadable.chargeNoun>無人機</DMS_Apparel_PackVerling.comps.CompApparelReloadable.chargeNoun>
  <!-- EN: on cooldown -->
  <DMS_Apparel_PackVerling.comps.CompApparelReloadable.cooldownGerund>準備中</DMS_Apparel_PackVerling.comps.CompApparelReloadable.cooldownGerund>
  <!-- EN: verlingbrid drone belt -->
  <DMS_Apparel_PackVerling.verbs.Verb_Deploy.label>部署槳鳥</DMS_Apparel_PackVerling.verbs.Verb_Deploy.label>
  
  <!-- EN: scanner pack -->
  <DMS_Apparel_PackScanner.label>掃描器背包</DMS_Apparel_PackScanner.label>
  <!-- EN: A wearable pack that allows the user to deploy a battery-powered perimeter scanner. The pack contains a propulsion device, letting the user launch the scanner a short distance. The scanner battery lasts for several hours. -->
  <DMS_Apparel_PackScanner.description>一種可穿戴的背包，讓使用者能部署以電池供電的周界掃描器。背包內建推進裝置，可將掃描器投射到短距離外。掃描器的電池可持續數小時。</DMS_Apparel_PackScanner.description>
  
  <!-- EN: scanner pack capsule -->
  <DMS_Grenade_ScannerPack.label>掃描器投射艙</DMS_Grenade_ScannerPack.label>
  
